# Default owner for the whole tree: opens a review request on every pull
# request. The "Require review from Code Owners" rule stays off while the
# project has a single maintainer — enabling it would block every PR on a
# second reviewer.
#
# The paths below are named separately anyway: they are the release pipeline,
# the chart operators deploy and the action third parties run in their own CI.
# When a second maintainer exists, the required-review ruleset is scoped to
# exactly these paths.
* @Fishkob

/.github/workflows/ @Fishkob
/.github/actions/ @Fishkob
/action.yml @Fishkob
/deploy/ @Fishkob
/scripts/security/ @Fishkob
/install.sh @Fishkob
/SECURITY.md @Fishkob
